<title>JAPAN: Fuji Distribution - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Fuji Distribution - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 17.89		vs	   16.98</p>
<p> Operating	  587    million    vs	  523    million</p>
<p> Current	    608    million    vs	  559    million</p>
<p> Net		  298    million    vs	  237    million</p>
<p> EPS		   11.97 yen	  vs	    9.53 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     25 million	  vs	  25 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  4.00 yen	  vs	    4.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Fuji Distribution Co Ltd is a distribution firm belonging to the Fuji Electric group.</p>
